{# Horizontal scroll-snap gallery of KTO-sourced hero images (architecture.md §9: CSS
   scroll-snap, no carousel library; desktop arrow buttons are a later JS enhancement).
   Param: images (Gallery[]) — mock now; real image files don't exist yet for any region
   (Phase-1b mock data references paths that were never generated), so each item renders as a
   labeled placeholder box rather than a broken <img> — swap to a real <img src> once real
   assets are sourced, the license/attribution plumbing is already here. #}
{% if images.length %}
<div class="gallery">
  {% for img in images %}
  <figure class="gallery__item">
    <div class="media-placeholder gallery__media" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <figcaption>{{ img.attribution }}</figcaption>
  </figure>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
{% set message = "No gallery images currently available for this region." %}
{% include "partials/empty-state.njk" %}
{% endif %}
<p class="data-provenance">Data from the Korea Tourism Organization (KTO) OpenAPI — currently mock data, live via the proxy layer in a later phase.</p>
